    "instructions": "1. Combine the whiskey, lemon juice, lime juice, sugar syrup, absinthe and egg white in a cocktail shaker and dry shake to combine. Add a scoop of ice and shake very hard for at least 30 second, then strain into an ice-filled glass. Top with 1 or 2 ounces of club soda, to taste.",
